From 45c06ae7dff71c03c04cbf9df26d56ef53f60ee4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:41:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 239/239] ipa: rkisp2: imx415: Add the noise reduction and
 sharpening calibration

Enable the spatial noise reduction and the sharpening with the YNR,
UVNR, SHARP and EDGEFILTER calibrations of the Rockchip IQ file for
this sensor (normal mode, LSNR setting), converted with nr-iq2yaml.py.
The edge filter kernels and direction minimum, which the AIQ sets in
code, are carried over as tuning values.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
